				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλονιστήρ</span>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραμήρια</span></b> , τά, <i>inside of the thighs</i>, <i><span class="en">
